---
title: Booking and Payment — no overbooking, no unpaid confirmations
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Next.js
    participant A as NestJS API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant S as Stripe
    participant M as Email

    C->>W: Choose a session and seats
    W->>A: POST /bookings
    activate A

    rect rgb(232, 237, 244)
    Note over A,D: One transaction. Concurrent attempts on the<br/>same session queue behind the row lock.
    A->>D: BEGIN
    A->>D: SELECT id FROM sessions WHERE id = $1 FOR UPDATE
    A->>D: Count seats: CONFIRMED + (PENDING AND holdExpiresAt > now)
    alt Not enough seats left
        A->>D: ROLLBACK
        A-->>W: 409 — this session is now full
        W-->>C: Offer the next available date
    else Seats available
        A->>D: INSERT booking (PENDING, holdExpiresAt = now + 15 min)
        A->>D: COMMIT
    end
    end

    A->>S: Create PaymentIntent (amount snapshotted on the booking)
    S-->>A: client_secret
    A-->>W: booking reference + client_secret
    deactivate A

    W->>C: Stripe Elements — card fields inside Stripe's iframe
    Note over W,S: Card details never touch our servers (NFR-4, SAQ-A)
    C->>S: Submit card

    par Browser is only a hint
        S-->>W: redirect to confirmation page
        W->>A: GET /bookings/:reference (poll)
    and Server-side truth
        S->>A: webhook payment_intent.succeeded
        activate A
        A->>A: Verify signature, idempotent on paymentIntentId
        A->>D: Booking → CONFIRMED, record Payment
        A->>M: Send confirmation (+ Zoom link if online)
        A->>D: Write EmailLog row
        deactivate A
    end

    A-->>W: status CONFIRMED
    W-->>C: Booking confirmed

    rect rgb(253, 246, 227)
    Note over A,D: Failure paths
    opt Customer abandons payment
        A->>D: Cron sweeps expired PENDING holds every minute
        Note right of D: Seats released automatically
    end
    opt Webhook arrives after the hold expired
        A->>S: Refund automatically
        A->>M: Alert the admin
        Note right of A: Never silently overbook
    end
    end
